  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧創新與永續社會責任",
    "sub_ename": "INTELLIGENT INNOVATION AND SUSTAINABLE SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY",
    "describe_ch": "在數位資訊發達的時代下，探討企業或機構組織如何透過數位化、智慧化的創新應用，協助企業善盡企業社會責任(CSR)、機構組織達成永續發展之目標。同時，將以社會企業(Social Enterprise)個案來進行研討從發現問題、解決問題、形成方案的社會創新過程，讓學生了解如何透過智慧創新來協助在地企業或機構組織解決問題，如銀髮社會、地方創生及環境永續等議題，並透過創意發想，提出讓企業或機構組織永續發展之可行解決方案。",
    "describe_eh": "This course examines the feasibility of the combination of intelligent innovation, corporate social responsibility (CSR) and social enterprise. Based on the approaches of problem-based learning, students can learn the related knowledge of intelligent innovation, CSR and social enterprise and apply the concept of social innovation to the local issues related to the silver's social development, local creation, and environmental sustainability. Finally, we expect that students can creatively propose feasible solutions for the sustainable development of social enterprise.",
